{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-ac340d00aa568bb7393e4ba8b8f98afe8c8b7e5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]]. Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies. The staff handbook states core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-43e04700f165a30e5870a60b8fbf2b8dafe85aad \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].","expected_sha256":"95599f78b5502ced097bf6c3a8a462f93868e193ae36501badd312db3464f557","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Added the core working hours from the board resolution with exact citation, noted the difference with the staff handbook, and stated that the resolution applies, as requested."}